# Wave-5 R-045: Tesla Troopers charge a Tesla Coil (Overpowerable=yes).
# [RE: abilities-w5.md §3] With the base short of power the coil is offline;
# two adjacent troopers keep it online (IsPowerOnline needs >= 2 overpowerers),
# three overpower it (IsOverpowered: n >= 3 at low power -> OPCoilBolt).
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click start
until 120 scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
# A coil with no power plant: the house is low on power.
cheat place TESLA 0 building 0:GACNST -16 -8
wait 2
assert power_drain > power_out @R-045:C
cheat spawn E2 1 building 0:TESLA -6 +0
wait 150
assert uhp(1,E2) == 125 @R-045:C
assert overpowerers == 0 @R-045:C
# Two troopers beside the coil charge it: online without base power.
cheat spawn SHK 0 building 0:TESLA +1 +0
cheat spawn SHK 0 building 0:TESLA +1 +1
until 60 overpowerers >= 2 @R-045:C
until 300 units(1,E2) == 0 @R-045:C
assert overpowered == 0 @R-045:C
# A third trooper overpowers it (OPCoilBolt).
cheat spawn SHK 0 building 0:TESLA +0 +1
until 60 overpowerers >= 3 @R-045:C
assert overpowered == 1 @R-045:C
shot tesla_charged
end
